Package: quickcommands
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: bash, fzf
Maintainer: Arif Islam <arifislam.swe@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/arifislam-me/quickcommands
Description: Smart command manager for terminal productivity
 Save terminal commands and pick them from an fzf menu. Press Ctrl+Q
 (configurable with "quickcommands key set") to search, Ctrl+S to save and
 Ctrl+D to delete; the chosen command is placed on the command line.
 Works with bash only.
